            "language": "python",
            "code": "def factorial(n):\n    if n == 1:\n        return 1\n    return n * factorial(n - 1)\n\nprint(factorial(5))",
            "output": "120",
            "note": {
              "hinglish": "n == 1 base case hai. Har call mein n ek kam hota hai, isliye chain rukti hai aur 120 wapas aata hai.",
              "english": "n == 1 is the base case. In every call n drops by one, so the chain stops and 120 comes back.",
              "hindi": "n == 1 base case है। हर कॉल में n एक कम होता है, इसलिए chain रुकती है और 120 वापस आता है।"
            }
