            "code": "from functools import reduce\n\nmarks = [45, 78, 90, 32, 66]\nwith_grace = list(map(lambda m: m + 5, marks))\npassed = list(filter(lambda m: m >= 40, marks))\ntotal = reduce(lambda a, b: a + b, marks)\nprint(with_grace)\nprint(passed)\nprint(total)",
