          "hinglish": "Player ki 5 pasand ki list banao: [\"rock\", \"paper\", \"scissors\", \"rock\", \"paper\"]. random.seed(6) lagakar computer ki pasand nikalo, decide_winner se har round ka result nikalo, aur score print karo. Jo pehle 3 round jeete, wahi winner hai — loop ko break se roko.",
          "english": "Make a list of 5 player choices: [\"rock\", \"paper\", \"scissors\", \"rock\", \"paper\"]. Set random.seed(6) to get the computer choice, find each round result with decide_winner, and print the score. Whoever wins 3 rounds first is the winner — stop the loop with break.",
          "hindi": "Player की 5 पसंद की list बनाओ: [\"rock\", \"paper\", \"scissors\", \"rock\", \"paper\"]। random.seed(6) लगाकर computer की पसंद निकालो, decide_winner से हर round का result निकालो, और score print करो। जो पहले 3 round जीते, वही winner है — लूप को break से रोको।"
