          "hinglish": "Starter code chalao. Phir distance aur predict function jodo (section wale code jaisi) aur do naye student ki jaanch karo: [70, 75] aur [30, 40]. Done tab mana jayega jab output mein dono centre aur dono test ke jawab — chaar line hon.",
